Subject: Gate unused ServiceAccount token automount remediation on preflight checks

Why: Without explicit pre-flight gates on ServiceAccount token auto-mounting, the Platform Agent proposes `automountServiceAccountToken: false` solely from Kubernetes RBAC emptiness and patches workloads whose ServiceAccounts carry `iam.gke.io/gcp-service-account` Workload Identity annotations or whose containers explicitly mount `/var/run/secrets/kubernetes.io/serviceaccount`, while wasting turns attempting `kubectl exec` or `kubectl logs` probes.
